sequenceDiagram
    participant browser as Browser
    participant lms as LMS
    participant tool as Semester
    participant store as Store
    participant ags as AGS
    lms->>tool: OIDC login initiation
    tool->>store: Store browser-bound state and nonce hashes
    tool->>lms: Authorize openid id_token form_post
    lms-->>tool: Callback id_token and state
    tool->>tool: Verify RS256 and message-specific claims
    tool->>store: Atomically consume launch transaction
    tool->>lms: Signed client assertion token request
    lms-->>tool: Granted service token
    tool->>ags: Discover or create bound line item
    tool->>ags: POST exact approved score event
    tool->>ags: GET results and compare normalized score
